[00:54] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'piece of dependable modern technology that will make your life amazing. And then, like 3 weeks later, it begins. The starter ink runs out after printing 11 pages and a picture of a frog. You don\'t'

[01:06] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'use it for a month and then somehow the ink dries up. And then you need new ink, except you can\'t just buy ink. Oh, no, no, no, no, no. You need the special sacred printer blood made specifically for your printer, which costs'

