VISUAL: Creator holding the PeriPage printer, showcasing its portability.
AUDIO: 'she was sold. Well, not sold, I bought it. She contributed nothing financially to this transaction, but she was happy, which is all the payment I need. Happy aunts are the best kind of currency for'

